  "notes": "Follows the Idefics3 architecture and uses the same transformers implementation (blog, card); no successor-of relation to Idefics3 is recorded because SmolVLM opens a separate line. Vision encoder: Google's shape-optimized SigLIP (cross-organisation, not recorded). SmolVLM-256M and SmolVLM-500M were presented on 2025-01-23 as new additions to the SmolVLM family and are kept inline because they share the name stem. The id carries -1 because huggingface.smolvlm is the family id."
